{"2942500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HELLDROP", "steam_appid": 2942500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a minimalist-style flight shooter game where your mission is to pilot a spaceship deep underground and detonate a nuclear bomb at the planet's core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/9706dd14a516f534e8bffaea172aef0c.poster.avif?t=1785862591\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/9706dd14a516f534e8bffaea172aef0c.webm?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/9706dd14a516f534e8bffaea172aef0c.mp4?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Absorb Modules, Enhance the Chassis</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four modules can be synthesized into different skills depending on their shapes. Synthesized skills can be adjusted based on the spaceship's configuration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/63111de0200fc3282bdb7a0202e26540.poster.avif?t=1785862591\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/63111de0200fc3282bdb7a0202e26540.webm?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/63111de0200fc3282bdb7a0202e26540.mp4?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/6a38e524b54d1175436272acf45c3d66.poster.avif?t=1785862591\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/6a38e524b54d1175436272acf45c3d66.webm?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/6a38e524b54d1175436272acf45c3d66.mp4?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adjust the Chassis, Upgrade Abilities</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every sacrifice is valuable. The ores obtained during missions can be used to upgrade and modify the next spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/2d135cc8fe3fa883e4baf181fa9ae0ee.poster.avif?t=1785862591\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/2d135cc8fe3fa883e4baf181fa9ae0ee.webm?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/2d135cc8fe3fa883e4baf181fa9ae0ee.mp4?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge Bosses, Breakthrough Levels</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside each planet, there are bizarre Bosses defending their lairs. You must defeat the core Boss to destroy the entire planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/d3df018c3a8980832cca7bd380c8b69c.poster.avif?t=1785862591\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/d3df018c3a8980832cca7bd380c8b69c.webm?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/d3df018c3a8980832cca7bd380c8b69c.mp4?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can snap them into any shape during combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/82307eb94cbf5641b29bf46beee2438c.poster.avif?t=1785862591\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/82307eb94cbf5641b29bf46beee2438c.webm?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/82307eb94cbf5641b29bf46beee2438c.mp4?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a minimalist-style flight shooter game where your mission is to pilot a spaceship deep underground and detonate a nuclear bomb at the planet's core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/9706dd14a516f534e8bffaea172aef0c.poster.avif?t=1785862591\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/9706dd14a516f534e8bffaea172aef0c.webm?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/9706dd14a516f534e8bffaea172aef0c.mp4?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"