500/extras/2d135cc8fe3fa883e4baf181fa9ae0ee.poster.avif?t=1785862591\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/2d135cc8fe3fa883e4baf181fa9ae0ee.webm?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/2d135cc8fe3fa883e4baf181fa9ae0ee.mp4?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge Bosses, Breakthrough Levels</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside each planet, there are bizarre Bosses defending their lairs. You must defeat the core Boss to destroy the entire planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/d3df018c3a8980832cca7bd380c8b69c.poster.avif?t=1785862591\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/d3df018c3a8980832cca7bd380c8b69c.webm?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/d3df018c3a8980832cca7bd380c8b69c.mp4?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can snap them into any shape during combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/82307eb94cbf5641b29bf46beee2438c.poster.avif?t=1785862591\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras/82307eb94cbf5641b29bf46beee2438c.webm?t=1785862591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942500/extras